<div class="container text-center p-4 m-4">
    <h1 class="fw-bolder">QuizVerse An Online Quiz System</h1>
    <p class="text-bg-info p-4 m-4">QuizVerse is an online quiz system in which you can test your knowledge by choosing quizes of your own choice and attempting it.
        It gives your attempt scores the moment you submit your quiz.
    </p>
    <div class="container p-4">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <p class="card-text fw-bold">Admin</p>
                        <p class="card-text">An admin has the authority to create quizes . An admin can keep record of all attempts of users.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <p class="card-text fw-bold">User</p>
                        <p class="card-text">A user can choose and attempt quizes of their own choice and get scores for each attempt .</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
